        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Left knee inspection"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "No obvious effusion or erythema. Patella appears slightly lateral compared with the right. Left tibial tuberosity appears somewhat more lateral; bony contour symmetrical and no discrete mass."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-10",
